        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong>우리 집 분위기, 한 끗 바꿔줄 아이템을 찾는다면? 👀</strong></p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">리빙과 인테리어의 새로운 취향을 더하는<strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"color: var(--point-color-0, #FF0066);\">LiLA</strong>가 부산으로 돌아왔습니다.</p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">지금 바로 사전등록하고, 새로운 브랜드와 트렌드를 직접 만나보세요!</p>",
