      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "14px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: #fff0f8;\">영남지역</strong>에서 자신만의 색을 만들어가는 <strong style=\"background-color: #fff0f8;\">로컬 브랜드를 한자리에서</strong> 만나는 특별 기획전입니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">리빙, 디자인, 라이프스타일 등 다양한 분야의 브랜드를 통해 지역이 가진 고유한 분위기와 새로운 취향을 발견해 보세요!</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong>📢 HIGHLIGHTS</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff0f8;\">🚩지역 핫플 인테리어 편집샵 탐방</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff0f8;\">🚩로컬 리빙 편집샵의 라이프스타일 제안</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff0f8;\">🚩스트릿 브랜드로 보는 도시감성</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p>",
